<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-sRIl4kxILFvY47J16cr9ZwB07vP4J8+LH7qKQnuqkuIAvNWLzeN8tE5YBujZqJLB" crossorigin="anonymous">
<title>SPARK  Ideas. Voices. Possibilities.</title>

<style>
    :root{
        --cream:#F7F0E3;
        --ink:#171717;
        --orange:#F36B21;
        --pink:#F25A8A;
        --yellow:#F7D447;
        --green:#79A96B;
        --purple:#A78BCE;
        --blue:#69C6D3;
        --white:#FFFDF8;
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}

    body{
        background:var(--cream);
        color:var(--ink);
        font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        overflow-x:hidden;
        line-height:1.5;
    }

    h1,h2,h3,.display,.sticker,.nav-logo{
        font-family:Impact, Haettenschweiler, "Arial Black", sans-serif;
        letter-spacing:normal;
        line-height:.9;
    }

    p{max-width:680px}

    a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}

    /* ---------------- NAV ---------------- */

    nav{
        position:sticky;
        top:0;
        z-index:1000;
        display:flex;
        align-items:center;
        justify-content:space-between;
        padding:18px 5vw;
        background:rgba(247,240,227,.94);
        backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
        border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);
    }

    .nav-logo{
        font-size:2rem;
        color:var(--orange);
    }

    .nav-links{
        display:flex;
        gap:28px;
        align-items:center;
        font-size:.82rem;
        font-weight:800;
        text-transform:uppercase;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover{text-decoration:underline}

    .nav-cta{
        background:var(--ink);
        color:var(--cream);
        padding:10px 17px;
        border-radius:30px;
    }

    /* ---------------- GLOBAL ---------------- */

    section{
        position:relative;
        padding:110px 7vw;
        overflow:hidden;
    }

    .eyebrow{
        display:inline-block;
        font-size:.72rem;
        font-weight:900;
        letter-spacing:.12em;
        text-transform:uppercase;
        border:2px solid var(--ink);
        padding:7px 12px;
        border-radius:30px;
        background:var(--yellow);
        margin-bottom:25px;
    }

    .section-title{
        font-size:clamp(4rem,9vw,9rem);
        max-width:1000px;
        text-transform:uppercase;
    }

    .body-copy{
        font-size:1.05rem;
        margin-top:25px;
    }

    .button{
        display:inline-flex;
        align-items:center;
        justify-content:center;
        padding:30px 44px;
        border:2px solid var(--ink);
        border-radius:999px;
        font-size:1.56rem;
        font-weight:900;
        text-transform:uppercase;
        transition:.2s ease;
        margin-top:30px;
        margin-right:8px;
    }

    .button:hover{
        transform:translateY(-4px) rotate(-1deg);
        box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--ink);
    }

    .button.dark{
        background:var(--ink);
        color:var(--cream);
    }

    .scribble{
        font-family:"Comic Sans MS", cursive;
        font-weight:700;
    }

    /* ---------------- HERO ---------------- */

    .hero{
        min-height:88vh;
        display:grid;
        grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;
        align-items:center;
        padding-top:70px;
        background:var(--cream);
    }

    .hero h1{
        font-size:clamp(5rem,12vw,12rem);
        color:var(--orange);
        text-transform:uppercase;
        max-width:850px;
    }

    .hero-sub{
        font-size:1.15rem;
        max-width:620px;
        margin-top:28px;
    }

    .hero-art{
        position:relative;
        min-height:520px;
    }

    .burst{
        position:absolute;
        width:370px;
        height:370px;
        background:var(--yellow);
        left:50%;
        top:50%;
        transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
        clip-path:polygon(50% 0%,60% 18%,75% 5%,78% 25%,98% 20%,88% 40%,100% 50%,82% 59%,95% 76%,76% 75%,75% 98%,58% 83%,47% 100%,40% 82%,22% 95%,25% 76%,3% 77%,17% 59%,0% 50%,19% 40%,5% 22%,25% 25%,24% 4%,41% 17%);
        animation:spin 18s linear infinite;
    }

    @keyframes spin{to{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(360deg)}}

    .hero-card{
        position:absolute;
        left:50%;
        top:50%;
        transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-5deg);
        width:270px;
        height:360px;
        background:var(--orange);
        border:3px solid var(--ink);
        box-shadow:12px 12px 0 var(--ink);
        padding:25px;
        display:flex;
        flex-direction:column;
        justify-content:space-between;
        z-index:2;
    }

    .hero-card .mini{
        font-size:.75rem;
        font-weight:900;
        text-transform:uppercase;
    }

    .hero-card h2{
        font-size:4.5rem;
        color:var(--cream);
    }

    .hero-card .logo-img{
        width:100%;
        height:auto;
        display:block;
    }

    .hero-card .dots{
        display:flex;
        gap:10px;
    }

    .hero-card .dots span{
        width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--ink);
    }

    .hero-card .dots span:nth-child(1){background:var(--pink)}
    .hero-card .dots span:nth-child(2){background:var(--green)}
    .hero-card .dots span:nth-child(3){background:var(--blue)}
    .hero-card .dots span:nth-child(4){background:var(--purple)}

    .float{
        position:absolute;
        z-index:5;
        border:2px solid var(--ink);
        padding:11px 15px;
        font-weight:900;
        background:var(--white);
        box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--ink);
    }

    .float.one{right:2%;top:15%;transform:rotate(8deg);background:var(--pink)}
    .float.two{left:0;bottom:12%;transform:rotate(-8deg);background:var(--green)}
    .float.three{right:8%;bottom:4%;transform:rotate(5deg);background:var(--purple)}

    /* ---------------- INTRO ---------------- */

    .intro{
        background:var(--ink);
        color:var(--cream);
        text-align:center;
    }

    .intro .section-title{
        margin:auto;
        color:var(--yellow);
    }

    .intro p{
        margin:35px auto 0;
        font-size:1.2rem;
    }

    .question{
        margin:55px auto 0;
        max-width:900px;
        font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4.5rem);
        font-family:"Comic Sans MS", cursive;
        transform:rotate(-2deg);
    }

    /* ---------------- WHY ---------------- */

    .why{
        display:grid;
        grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
        gap:70px;
        align-items:center;
    }

    .why .big-statement{
        font-size:clamp(3.8rem,7vw,7rem);
        font-weight:900;
        line-height:.9;
    }

    .why .big-statement span{color:var(--orange)}

    .phone{
        width:270px;
        height:500px;
        background:#111;
        border:7px solid var(--ink);
        border-radius:35px;
        margin:auto;
        padding:35px 17px 20px;
        transform:rotate(7deg);
        box-shadow:16px 16px 0 var(--pink);
        position:relative;
    }

    .phone:before{
        content:"";
        position:absolute;
        top:13px;
        left:50%;
        transform:translateX(-50%);
        width:80px;height:9px;
        background:#333;border-radius:20px;
    }

    .phone-screen{
        background:var(--blue);
        height:100%;
        padding:18px;
        overflow:hidden;
    }

    .notification{
        background:var(--white);
        border:2px solid var(--ink);
        padding:12px;
        margin-bottom:12px;
        font-weight:800;
        transform:rotate(-2deg);
    }

    /* ---------------- TOPICS ---------------- */

    .topics{
        background:var(--yellow);
    }

    .topic-cloud{
        display:flex;
        flex-wrap:wrap;
        gap:15px;
        margin-top:55px;
        align-items:center;
        justify-content:center;
    }

    .topic{
        border:3px solid var(--ink);
        padding:15px 22px;
        font-weight:900;
        text-transform:uppercase;
        background:var(--cream);
        box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--ink);
        transition:.2s;
    }

    .topic:nth-child(2n){background:var(--pink);transform:rotate(2deg)}
    .topic:nth-child(3n){background:var(--green);transform:rotate(-2deg)}
    .topic:nth-child(4n){background:var(--purple);transform:rotate(1deg)}
    .topic:hover{transform:translateY(-7px) rotate(0deg)}

    /* ---------------- FEATURES ---------------- */

    .feature{
        display:grid;
        grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
        min-height:650px;
        padding:0;
    }

    .feature-copy{
        padding:100px 7vw;
        display:flex;
        flex-direction:column;
        justify-content:center;
    }

    .feature-visual{
        display:flex;
        align-items:center;
        justify-content:center;
        min-height:600px;
        position:relative;
        padding:60px;
    }

    .feature:nth-of-type(6) .feature-visual{background:var(--pink)}
    .feature:nth-of-type(7) .feature-visual{background:var(--blue)}
    .feature:nth-of-type(8) .feature-visual{background:var(--green)}

    .feature h2{
        font-size:clamp(4rem,7vw,7rem);
        text-transform:uppercase;
    }

    .feature p{
        margin-top:25px;
        font-size:1.05rem;
    }

    .issue-tag{
        display:inline-block;
        background:var(--orange);
        padding:7px 12px;
        border:2px solid var(--ink);
        border-radius:20px;
        font-size:.7rem;
        font-weight:900;
        text-transform:uppercase;
        width:max-content;
    }

    .bed{
        width:340px;
        height:180px;
        background:var(--cream);
        border:4px solid var(--ink);
        position:relative;
        transform:rotate(-5deg);
        box-shadow:12px 12px 0 var(--ink);
    }

    .bed:before{
        content:"";
        position:absolute;
        width:120px;height:100px;
        background:var(--purple);
        border:3px solid var(--ink);
        left:25px;top:-55px;
        border-radius:55px 55px 10px 10px;
    }

    .bed:after{
        content:"20s?";
        position:absolute;
        right:30px;top:30px;
        font-size:3rem;
        font-weight:900;
        transform:rotate(5deg);
    }

    .scroll-phone{
        width:250px;
        height:450px;
        background:var(--ink);
        border:7px solid var(--cream);
        border-radius:32px;
        padding:20px;
        transform:rotate(7deg);
        box-shadow:13px 13px 0 var(--orange);
    }

    .scroll-screen{
        height:100%;
        background:var(--cream);
        padding:15px;
    }

    .scroll-word{
        font-size:2.6rem;
        font-weight:900;
        line-height:.85;
        margin-bottom:18px;
    }

    .scroll-word:nth-child(1){color:var(--pink)}
    .scroll-word:nth-child(2){color:var(--green)}
    .scroll-word:nth-child(3){color:var(--orange)}

    .brain{
        font-size:13rem;
        filter:drop-shadow(10px 10px 0 var(--ink));
    }

    /* ---------------- CULTURE ---------------- */

    .culture{
        background:var(--purple);
    }

    .culture-grid{
        display:grid;
        grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;
        gap:20px;
        margin-top:55px;
    }

    .culture-card{
        min-height:330px;
        border:3px solid var(--ink);
        background:var(--cream);
        padding:25px;
        position:relative;
    }

    .culture-card:nth-child(2){background:var(--orange);transform:rotate(2deg)}
    .culture-card:nth-child(3){background:var(--yellow);transform:rotate(-2deg)}

    .culture-card h3{
        font-size:3.5rem;
        margin-bottom:30px;
    }

    .culture-card .scribble{
        position:absolute;
        bottom:25px;
        font-size:1.1rem;
    }

    /* ---------------- PLAY ---------------- */

    .play{
        background:var(--green);
        text-align:center;
    }

    .play .section-title{margin:auto}

    .play-sub{
        margin:30px auto;
        font-size:1.2rem;
    }

    .crossword{
        margin:60px auto 0;
        width:min(500px,90vw);
        display:grid;
        grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);
        border:4px solid var(--ink);
        background:var(--ink);
        gap:3px;
        transform:rotate(-2deg);
        box-shadow:15px 15px 0 var(--pink);
    }

    .crossword div{
        aspect-ratio:1;
        background:var(--cream);
        display:flex;
        align-items:center;
        justify-content:center;
        font-weight:900;
        font-size:clamp(.8rem,2vw,1.3rem);
    }

    .crossword .empty{background:var(--ink)}
    .crossword .highlight{background:var(--yellow)}

    .trivia{
        margin-top:110px;
    }

    .levels{
        display:flex;
        justify-content:center;
        gap:18px;
        flex-wrap:wrap;
        margin-top:45px;
    }

    .level{
        padding:25px 35px;
        border:3px solid var(--ink);
        font-weight:900;
        background:var(--pink);
        box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--ink);
        transform:rotate(-2deg);
    }

    .level:nth-child(2){background:var(--yellow);transform:rotate(2deg)}
    .level:nth-child(3){background:var(--purple);transform:rotate(-1deg)}

    /* ---------------- CREATIVE ---------------- */

    .creative{
        background:var(--cream);
    }

    .creative-header{
        display:flex;
        justify-content:space-between;
        align-items:end;
        gap:30px;
        flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .gallery{
        margin-top:60px;
        display:grid;
        grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);
        grid-auto-rows:80px;
        gap:16px;
    }

    .gallery-item{
        border:3px solid var(--ink);
        display:flex;
        align-items:center;
        justify-content:center;
        font-weight:900;
        font-size:1.2rem;
        overflow:hidden;
        box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--ink);
    }

    .gallery-item:nth-child(1){
        grid-column:1/6;grid-row:1/5;
        background:var(--pink);transform:rotate(-2deg);
    }

    .gallery-item:nth-child(2){
        grid-column:6/10;grid-row:1/4;
        background:var(--blue);transform:rotate(2deg);
    }

    .gallery-item:nth-child(3){
        grid-column:10/13;grid-row:1/6;
        background:var(--yellow);transform:rotate(-1deg);
    }

    .gallery-item:nth-child(4){
        grid-column:2/7;grid-row:5/9;
        background:var(--green);transform:rotate(1deg);
    }

    .gallery-item:nth-child(5){
        grid-column:7/11;grid-row:4/9;
        background:var(--purple);transform:rotate(-2deg);
    }

    .gallery-item:nth-child(6){
        grid-column:11/13;grid-row:6/9;
        background:var(--orange);transform:rotate(2deg);
    }

    /* ---------------- VOICE ---------------- */

    .voice{
        background:var(--orange);
        text-align:center;
    }

    .voice .section-title{margin:auto;color:var(--cream)}

    .sticky-wall{
        max-width:950px;
        margin:65px auto 0;
        display:grid;
        grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
        gap:25px;
    }

    .note{
        min-height:180px;
        background:var(--yellow);
        padding:30px;
        border:2px solid var(--ink);
        display:flex;
        align-items:center;
        justify-content:center;
        font-size:1.25rem;
        font-weight:900;
        box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--ink);
    }

    .note:nth-child(2){background:var(--pink);transform:rotate(3deg)}
    .note:nth-child(3){background:var(--blue);transform:rotate(-2deg)}

    /* ---------------- TEAM ---------------- */

    .team{
        background:var(--pink);
    }

    .team-list{
        margin-top:60px;
        display:grid;
        grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
        gap:18px;
    }

    .person{
        background:var(--cream);
        border:3px solid var(--ink);
        padding:22px;
        min-height:210px;
        display:flex;
        flex-direction:column;
        justify-content:end;
        box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--ink);
    }

    .person:nth-child(2){transform:rotate(2deg);background:var(--yellow)}
    .person:nth-child(3){transform:rotate(-2deg);background:var(--green)}
    .person:nth-child(4){transform:rotate(1deg);background:var(--purple)}

    .person h3{font-size:2.5rem}
    .person p{font-size:.78rem;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:8px}

    /* ---------------- BTC ---------------- */

    .btc{
        background:var(--ink);
        color:var(--cream);
        text-align:center;
    }

    .btc .section-title{
        color:var(--yellow);
        margin:auto;
    }

    .btc p{
        margin:35px auto 0;
        font-size:1.1rem;
    }

    /* ---------------- CTA ---------------- */

    .final{
        min-height:75vh;
        display:flex;
        align-items:center;
        justify-content:center;
        text-align:center;
        background:var(--yellow);
    }

    .final h2{
        font-size:clamp(5rem,11vw,11rem);
        max-width:1100px;
        margin:auto;
    }

    .final .small-line{
        margin:30px auto;
        font-size:1.35rem;
        font-family:"Comic Sans MS",cursive;
        transform:rotate(-2deg);
    }

    /* ---------------- FOOTER ---------------- */

    footer{
        background:var(--ink);
        color:var(--cream);
        padding:60px 7vw 35px;
        display:flex;
        justify-content:space-between;
        gap:30px;
        flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    footer .logo{
        font-family:Impact, sans-serif;
        color:var(--orange);
        font-size:4rem;
    }

    footer p, footer a{font-size:.82rem}
    footer a:hover{text-decoration:underline}

    /* ---------------- RESPONSIVE ---------------- */

    @media(max-width:900px){
        .hero,
        .why,
        .feature{
            grid-template-columns:1fr;
        }

        .hero-art{
            min-height:430px;
        }

        .culture-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}

        .team-list{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}

        .sticky-wall{grid-template-columns:1fr}

        .feature-visual{min-height:450px}

        .gallery{
            grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
            grid-auto-rows:180px;
        }

        .gallery-item:nth-child(n){
            grid-column:auto;
            grid-row:auto;
            transform:none;
        }
    }

    @media(max-width:600px){
        nav{padding:15px 5vw}
        .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta){display:none}

        section{padding:75px 6vw}

        .hero{min-height:auto;padding-top:70px}

        .hero h1{font-size:clamp(4.2rem,20vw,7rem)}

        .hero-art{min-height:390px}

        .burst{width:270px;height:270px}

        .hero-card{
            width:210px;
            height:285px;
        }

        .hero-card h2{font-size:3.5rem}

        .team-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}

        .gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr}

        .gallery-item{min-height:230px}

        .phone{width:230px;height:420px}
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
    <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Edition 01 • September 2026</span>
        <h1>Ideas.<br>Voices.<br>Possibilities.</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">
            A little space for big ideas, strange questions, creative minds
            and everything in between.
        </p>

        <a class="button dark" href="https://wa.me/7980598096">Subscribe Now</a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-art">
        <div class="burst"></div>

        <div class="hero-card">
            <span class="mini">Youth newsletter</span>
            <img class="logo-img" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="SPARK logo">
            <span class="mini">Think. Question. Create.</span>
            <div class="dots">
                <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="float one">WAIT... WHAT?</div>
        <div class="float two">✦ made by young voices</div>
        <div class="float three">questions welcome.</div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT IS SPARK -->
<section class="intro" id="edition">
    <span class="eyebrow">Okay, but...</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">What exactly<br>is SPARK?</h2>

    <p>
        SPARK is a youth newsletter built around stories, ideas, creativity
        and conversations that matter.
    </p>

    <div class="question">
        We are not here to tell young people what to think.<br>
        We are here to give them somewhere to think out loud.
    </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY -->
<section class="why">
    <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Why SPARK exists</span>

        <div class="big-statement">
            We have enough<br>
            <span>information.</span><br>
            We need more<br>
            conversations.
        </div>

        <p class="body-copy">
            The world moves quickly. Trends disappear overnight. Technology
            keeps changing how we learn, work and communicate. SPARK is an
            attempt to slow things down, even if only for a few pages.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="phone">
        <div class="phone-screen">
            <div class="notification">NEW TREND JUST DROPPED.</div>
            <div class="notification">YOUR FRIEND GOT A JOB.</div>
            <div class="notification">AI CHANGED EVERYTHING.</div>
            <div class="notification">YOU HAVE 37 NEW EMAILS.</div>
            <div class="notification">...but what do YOU think?</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- TOPICS -->
<section class="topics">
    <span class="eyebrow">Inside SPARK</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">One newsletter.<br>A lot going on.</h2>

    <div class="topic-cloud">
        <span class="topic">Culture</span>
        <span class="topic">Career</span>
        <span class="topic">Mental Health</span>
        <span class="topic">Technology</span>
        <span class="topic">Books</span>
        <span class="topic">Music</span>
        <span class="topic">Events</span>
        <span class="topic">Creativity</span>
        <span class="topic">Youth</span>
        <span class="topic">Conversations</span>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- FEATURE: MENTAL HEALTH -->
